        "regression_hint": "A correct fix must make DirectoryTraversal.protectAgainstForExternal (and analogously protectAgainstInClassPath) enforce a path-segment boundary rather than a raw startsWith prefix match — e.g. reject unless the normalized resolved path equals the configured folder or begins with configuredFolder + \"/\". After the fix the PoV command must exit non-zero; before it, exit 0.",
